                                    <div class="testimonial-block__slide swiper-slide">
                        <div class="testimonial-block__slide--content"><p><span data-contrast="auto">At Sanctuary Group, one of the largest Housing Associations in the UK, with sites located across England and Scotland, our aim is to ensure our compliances are up to date in a timely fashion. BES Group have not disappointed. Communication is positive, quick, professional and with clarity. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">I would highly recommend them as a contractor, communication and understanding of the work requested is integral to my position within National Compliance.</span></p>
</div>
                        <div class="testimonial-block__slide--details">
                            <p>Charlotte Hampton </p>
                            <p>National Compliance Administration Officer</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                                    <div class="testimonial-block__slide swiper-slide">
                        <div class="testimonial-block__slide--content"><p>BES is a really disruptive force in the market, they are able to provide a variety of necessary services to their customers and none of the other big players are able to provide that breadth of services.</p>
</div>
