<section class="media-object" id="media_object_7">
    <div class="media-object__inner">
                    <h2 class="left">Distribution Board Upgrades with BES Group </h2>
                <div class="media-object__rows">
                                                <div class="media-object__row standard mobile-text-first">
                        <div class="media-object__column--content">
                            
<section class="full-width-content tbbi-wysiwyg-content">
    <p><span data-contrast="none">At BES Group we work across multiple industries such as <a href="https://besgroup.com/sectors/retail/">retail</a>, <a href="https://besgroup.com/sectors/hospitality-and-leisure/">hospitality</a>, <a href="https://besgroup.com/sectors/manufacturing/">manufacturing</a> and the public sector to support maintenance managers with their electrical safety plan. As part of our comprehensive service, we install and maintain <a href="https://besgroup.com/services/electrical/electrical-installation-project/">electrical installations</a>, including distribution board upgrades.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">If you’re a facilities or maintenance manager and have recently had an <a href="https://besgroup.com/services/electrical/eicr/">EICR inspection</a> highlight an issue or have installed some new electrical equipment on your premises, it may be time for an electrical panel upgrade. </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">There are a few reasons why you may need to update your panel including:</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="none">If your premises needs more power and the board isn’t providing enough, we can upgrade the supply of your distribution board</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="none">If there is any damage to the panel, we would recommend replacing the whole unit to prevent potential accidents</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="none">If the panel is out-dated and doesn’t have safety devices such as an SPD, RCD or RCBO, we can incorporate them within your board upgrade </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="4" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="none">If your distribution board is obsolete, we would replace the whole system</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></li>
</ul>
</section>                        </div>
