                <p class="accreditations-block__modal--inner--right--content">The Institute of Workplace and Facilities Management (IWFM) is a professional body advancing workplace and facilities management. Our partnership with IWFM showcases our commitment to industry excellence and fostering best practices in managing workspaces.</p>
                                    <p class="accreditations-block__modal--inner--right--legal">Legal entities:</p>
                    <ul>
