            </div>
            <div class="accreditations-block__modal--inner--right">
                <h4>Acclaim</h4>
                <p class="accreditations-block__modal--inner--right--content">Launched in 2012, Acclaim Accreditation is the health and safety accreditation service provided by Supplier Assessment Services. They carry out online assessments of business' health and safety documentation, as an independent, competent assurance of the systems we have in place. By choosing them, our customers can rest assured that they're receiving an industry leading, regulatory compliant electrical testing service. </p>
