<section class="process-block bg-default" id="process_block_10">
    <div class="process-block__inner">
        <div class="process-block__header">
            <h2>Our Distribution Board Upgrades process </h2>
                            <a class="cta green-text js-popup-modal-toggle" href="#18164" target="">Speak to us about the process</a>
                    </div>
        <div class="process-block__carousel">
            <div class="process-block__carousel--intro">
                <p>Discover how we deliver the best results for our clients.</p>
                <div class="process-block__carousel--controls">
                    <div class="process-block__carousel--controls--prev js-process-block-carousel-prev"><img src="https://besgroup.com/app/themes/bes/images/sectors-and-services/white-arrow-small.svg" alt="" /></div>
                    <div class="process-block__carousel--controls--next js-process-block-carousel-next"><img src="https://besgroup.com/app/themes/bes/images/sectors-and-services/white-arrow-small.svg" alt="" /></div>
                </div>
                                <a class="cta green-text" href="#18164" target="">Speak to us about the process</a>
                            </div>
            <div class="process-block__carousel--content swiper js-process-block-carousel">
                <div class="swiper-wrapper">    
                                            <div class="process-block__card swiper-slide">
                            <p class="process-block__card--number">01</p>
                            <h4>Planning</h4>
                            <p>We’ll identify the issue with your board to determine what type of distribution board is best suited to your electrical system. </p>
                        </div>
                                            <div class="process-block__card swiper-slide">
                            <p class="process-block__card--number">02</p>
                            <h4>Preparation</h4>
                            <p>We’ll prepare the area by removing any obstructions that could interfere with the upgrade and ensuring the current board is isolated and safe to work on. </p>
                        </div>
                                            <div class="process-block__card swiper-slide">
                            <p class="process-block__card--number">03</p>
                            <h4>Upgrades</h4>
                            <p>Our experienced engineers will replace the distribution board minimising downtime and providing temporary power where needed. </p>
                        </div>
                                            <div class="process-block__card swiper-slide">
                            <p class="process-block__card--number">04</p>
                            <h4>Testing</h4>
                            <p>We will then dead test the new board to ensure it is safe before reenergising and carrying out the life tests to ensure it is functioning correctly. </p>
                        </div>
                                            <div class="process-block__card swiper-slide">
                            <p class="process-block__card--number">05</p>
                            <h4>Documentation</h4>
                            <p>We’ll document the upgrade to provide a record of the work that was done, taking photographs and providing an electrical installation certificate (EIC) for your records. </p>
                        </div>
                                    </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
