<section class="faqs-block js-faqs-block" id="faqs_block_16">
    <div class="faqs-block__inner">
                    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
                <div class="faqs-block__grid">
                            <div class="faqs-block__card js-faq">
                    <div class="faqs-block__card--icon">
                        <img src="https://besgroup.com/app/themes/bes/images/sectors-and-services/faq-icon.svg" class="faqs-block__card--icon--desktop" alt="" />
                        <img src="https://besgroup.com/app/themes/bes/images/sectors-and-services/faq-icon-hover.svg" class="faqs-block__card--icon--mobile" alt="" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="faqs-block__card--content">
                        <h3 class="faqs-block__card--content--heading">When should I upgrade my Distribution board?</h3>
                        <div class="faqs-block__card--content--text js-faq-content closed">
                            <p><span data-contrast="auto">There are a few things to look out for that may indicate that your distribution board needs upgrading:</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="5" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="auto">Age:</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> Distribution boards typically have a lifespan of around 40 years. If your distribution board is older than this, it may be time to upgrade it.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559739&quot;:0}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="5" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="auto">Overcrowding:</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> If your distribution board is overcrowded, it may not be able to handle the current load. This can lead to overheating and a risk of fire.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559739&quot;:0}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="5" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="auto">Damage:</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> If your distribution board is damaged, it may not be safe to use. This could be caused by a number of things, such as water damage, </span><b><span data-contrast="auto">fire damage, or physical damage.</span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559739&quot;:0}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="5" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="4" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="auto">Incompatibility with new appliances:</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> If you are adding new appliances to your business or an EV charging point, you may need to upgrade your distribution board to accommodate the additional load.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559739&quot;:0}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="5" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="5" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="auto">Regulations:</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> The electrical regulations in the UK are constantly changing. If your distribution board does not meet the current regulations, you may need to upgrade it.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559739&quot;:0}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">If you&#8217;re unsure whether or not your distribution board needs upgrading, we’ll be able to assess your needs and recommend the best course of action.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
                            <button class="js-more-detail">More Detail</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                                            <div class="faqs-block__card js-faq">
                    <div class="faqs-block__card--icon">
                        <img src="https://besgroup.com/app/themes/bes/images/sectors-and-services/faq-icon.svg" class="faqs-block__card--icon--desktop" alt="" />
                        <img src="https://besgroup.com/app/themes/bes/images/sectors-and-services/faq-icon-hover.svg" class="faqs-block__card--icon--mobile" alt="" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="faqs-block__card--content">
                        <h3 class="faqs-block__card--content--heading">Do I need to update my electrical distribution board? </h3>
                        <div class="faqs-block__card--content--text js-faq-content closed">
                            <p><span data-contrast="auto">As a facilities manager, maintaining your electric distribution board should be part of your regular electrical maintenance plan. If you’re not sure whether you should upgrade your fuseboard, here are some of <span style="font-weight: 400;">the risks of an old or damaged consumer unit;</span></span></p>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="4" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="auto">Safety</span></b><span data-contrast="auto">: An upgraded distribution board is safer and less likely to cause a fire as older distribution boards may not have the same safety features as newer boards.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559739&quot;:0}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="4" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="auto">Capacity</span></b><span data-contrast="auto">: An upgraded distribution board will be able to handle more appliances and devices, giving you more flexibility. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559739&quot;:0}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="4" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="auto">Efficiency</span></b><span data-contrast="auto">: An upgraded distribution board will be more efficient, which can save you money on your energy bills. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559739&quot;:0}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="4" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="4" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="auto">Lifespan</span></b><span data-contrast="auto">: An upgraded distribution board will last longer, so you won’t have to worry about replacing it as often. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559739&quot;:0}"> </span></li>
</ul>
                            <button class="js-more-detail">More Detail</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                                            <div class="faqs-block__card js-faq">
                    <div class="faqs-block__card--icon">
                        <img src="https://besgroup.com/app/themes/bes/images/sectors-and-services/faq-icon.svg" class="faqs-block__card--icon--desktop" alt="" />
                        <img src="https://besgroup.com/app/themes/bes/images/sectors-and-services/faq-icon-hover.svg" class="faqs-block__card--icon--mobile" alt="" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="faqs-block__card--content">
                        <h3 class="faqs-block__card--content--heading">What are the compliance requirements for Distribution Boards?</h3>
                        <div class="faqs-block__card--content--text js-faq-content closed">
                            <p><span data-contrast="auto">The compliance requirements for distribution boards in the UK are set out in the </span><a href="https://electrical.theiet.org/bs-7671/"><span data-contrast="none">BS 7671:2018: The Wiring Regulations Requirements for Electrical Installations.</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> This standard sets out the requirements for the design, installation, and maintenance of electrical installations in the UK. </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><a href="https://landingpage.bsigroup.com/LandingPage/Series?UPI=BS%20EN%2060439"><span data-contrast="none">BS EN 60439-3: Low-voltage Switchgear and Control Gear Assemblies – Part 3: Distribution Boards.</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> This standard specifies the requirements for distribution boards for use in low-voltage electrical installations.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">As a facilities or maintenance manager, it is also your responsibility to remain compliant within </span><a href="https://www.hse.gov.uk/pubns/books/hsr25.htm"><span data-contrast="none">The Electricity at Work Regulations 1989 &#8211; HSE.</span></a><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
                            <button class="js-more-detail">More Detail</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                                            <div class="faqs-block__card js-faq">
                    <div class="faqs-block__card--icon">
                        <img src="https://besgroup.com/app/themes/bes/images/sectors-and-services/faq-icon.svg" class="faqs-block__card--icon--desktop" alt="" />
                        <img src="https://besgroup.com/app/themes/bes/images/sectors-and-services/faq-icon-hover.svg" class="faqs-block__card--icon--mobile" alt="" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="faqs-block__card--content">
                        <h3 class="faqs-block__card--content--heading">Does my electrical panel need regular maintenance after an upgrade? </h3>
                        <div class="faqs-block__card--content--text js-faq-content closed">
                            <p><span class="TextRun SCXW21355970 BCX8" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW21355970 BCX8">Once upgraded, your electrical panel </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW21355970 BCX8">will </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW21355970 BCX8">require</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW21355970 BCX8"> a </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW21355970 BCX8">EIC (Electrical installation Certificate. Going forward, it </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW21355970 BCX8">will need regular testing as part of your </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW21355970 BCX8">electrical </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW21355970 BCX8">maintenance plan. Our electricians</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW21355970 BCX8"> will be able to advise on the frequency, but it should be in line with your </span></span><a class="Hyperlink SCXW21355970 BCX8" href="https://besgroup.com/services/electrical/eicr/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span class="TextRun Underlined SCXW21355970 BCX8" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="none"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW21355970 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink">EICR inspection</span></span></a><span class="TextRun SCXW21355970 BCX8" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW21355970 BCX8"> every year, three years or five years depending on your premises</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW21355970 BCX8">. </span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW21355970 BCX8">Electrical board testing is recommended to detect issues and faults early on to avoid accidents and downtime.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW21355970 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
                            <button class="js-more-detail">More Detail</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                                            <div class="faqs-block__card js-faq">
                    <div class="faqs-block__card--icon">
                        <img src="https://besgroup.com/app/themes/bes/images/sectors-and-services/faq-icon.svg" class="faqs-block__card--icon--desktop" alt="" />
                        <img src="https://besgroup.com/app/themes/bes/images/sectors-and-services/faq-icon-hover.svg" class="faqs-block__card--icon--mobile" alt="" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="faqs-block__card--content">
                        <h3 class="faqs-block__card--content--heading">What is an electrical distribution board? </h3>
                        <div class="faqs-block__card--content--text js-faq-content closed">
                            <p><span data-contrast="none">A distribution board or distribution panel is the key component of all electrical supply installations. The electrical panel splits incoming electrical currents out to multiple secondary circuits within your electrical system, regulate circuit connections and protect against electrical overloads.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:300}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="none">Most workplaces will rely on a distribution board to divide and route their power around their premises and will usually be enclosed for safety. This is often known as a fuse box.</span><span data-contrast="none"> </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:300,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}"> </span></p>
                            <button class="js-more-detail">More Detail</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                                            <div class="faqs-block__card js-faq">
                    <div class="faqs-block__card--icon">
                        <img src="https://besgroup.com/app/themes/bes/images/sectors-and-services/faq-icon.svg" class="faqs-block__card--icon--desktop" alt="" />
                        <img src="https://besgroup.com/app/themes/bes/images/sectors-and-services/faq-icon-hover.svg" class="faqs-block__card--icon--mobile" alt="" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="faqs-block__card--content">
                        <h3 class="faqs-block__card--content--heading">Can you move an electrical panel? </h3>
                        <div class="faqs-block__card--content--text js-faq-content closed">
                            <p><span class="TextRun Highlight SCXW114593169 BCX8" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114593169 BCX8">In short, yes, a qualified electrician can move your electrical panel. However, this should only be carried out where necessary as it </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114593169 BCX8">will involve rewiring and rerouting of your current electrical system.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW114593169 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
                            <button class="js-more-detail">More Detail</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                                    </div>
                    <a class="cta green-text js-popup-modal-toggle" href="#18164" target="">Need more help? Let’s talk.</a>
            </div>
</section>
